    "updated_at": "2016-04-15T20:02:04Z",
    "body": "> xmp and listing actually have the same default rendering as pre.\n\nWhat the heck, I _swear_ I messed around with `xmp` a few years ago and it wasn't `white-space: pre` by default. >_<\n",
